{"id":"heirat","lemma":"Heirat","pos":"noun","rank":3138,"glosses":["marrying; marriage; wedding (the act of marrying; the contracting of a marriage)"],"ipa":"/ˈhaɪ̯ˌʁaːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c1/De-Heirat.ogg/De-Heirat.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Heirat","plural":"Heiraten"},"formAudio":{"Heiraten":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-heiraten.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Meine Eltern waren gegen unsere Heirat.","en":"My parents were opposed to our marriage.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"parents"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null]},{"text":"Sie denken über Heirat nach.","en":"They're thinking about getting married.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to think"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},null,{"g":"after / to"}]},{"text":"Unsere Heirat war arrangiert.","en":"Our marriage was arranged.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"to arrange","l":"arrangieren"}]},{"text":"Erst nach fünf Jahren hörte ich von seiner Heirat.","en":"It was not until five years later that I heard of his marriage.","words":[{"g":"first, at first"},{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"five (numerical value…"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Wir sollten heiraten.","en":"We should get married.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566004","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},null]}]}